cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these forecasts or this code, please cite it as below, and cite the Lai & Dzombak source data listed under references."
type: dataset
title: "Carbon Copies: Protostar Climate Challenge Submission (U.S. city climate forecasts 2019-2025)"
abstract: >-
  Yearly forecasts of average temperature, total precipitation, hottest-day temperature and
  cooling degree days for 210 U.S. cities, 2019-2025, made as of the end of 2018. Includes the
  open forecasting code (level + regionally pooled trend; delta-method CDD from daily weather),
  a rolling-origin backtest, a look-ahead (leakage) test and GIS-ready outputs.
